    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Add §208-h, Gen Muni L; add §14-117.1, NYC Ad Cd",
    "lawSection": "General Municipal Law",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S6726\n\nTITLE OF BILL:  An act to amend the general municipal law and the\nadministrative code of the city of New York, in relation to service by\npolice officers in an undercover capacity\n\nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:  To amend the general municipal law\nby adding a new section 208-h, and the administrative code by adding a\nnew section 14-117.1, regarding undercover police service.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:  Undercover service is one of the more difficult\nassignments for police officers. As such, after serving 36 months in\nthis assignment, the continuation should be optional.\n\nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY: S.7347-A 2012\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS: To be determined.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:  This act shall take effect immediately.\n\n",
